atus maintains potential for Fully Concealed Hand (4 points) or Concealed Hand (2 points)\n4. W5 has 3 tiles remaining, giving reasonable drawing chances\n5. Exposing a meld now limits my scoring potential significantly\n\nAnswer: Pass"}
